      ],
      "text": "Multi-island mode partitions agents into isolated groups with scoped state; migration moves selected agents between islands on a score-ranked schedule, carrying role, heartbeat config, attempts, and logs while notes and skills stay on the source island."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_642ecc87f8d114510b4607622cddbb5cd26f19a1dd8564ff83e91bcd69aa67a1",
